1 NAME Rasmus Nilsson //
2 GIVN Rasmus Nilsson
2 SURN Tyssen
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1629
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Norway
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The Evanger Boka has Rasmus married about 1672, wife not known. The first child, Haldor, was born 1667, 5 years before the marriage. By tradition, Haldor, being the first born, should have inherited the farm, but h
2 CONC e didn't. The second son Johannes, born 1672, inherited the farm, which leads me to believe that the woman Rasmus married was probably a widow, with a five year old son. I would think that if Haldor was the son of Rasmus, though t
2 CONC he marriage was long delayed, he would have inherited the farm
2 CONT Tyssen, Evanger boka #1: https://www.nb.no/items/f858da8656b327f73e68c55aaf1e30ff?page=21&searchText=Dalseid
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Rasmus NILSSON TYSSEN were as follows:
2 CONT
2 CONT 2 Haldor2 RASMUSSON TYSSEN , born 1667 in Voss, Norway. He married in 1697 in Voss, Norway Agate (JOHANNESDTR DALSEID) Rasmusson Tyssen .
2 CONT
2 CONT 3 Johannes2 RASMUSSON TYSSEN , born 1672 in Voss, Norway; died 1746 in Voss, Norway. He married Marita (JONSDTR FADNES) Rasmusson Tyssen .
2 CONT
2 CONT 4 Ole2 RASMUSSON TYSSEN , born 1684 in Voss, Norway; died 1741 in Voss, Norway. He married Marita (ASKJELSDTR FADNES) Rasmusson Tyssen .
2 CONT
2 CONT * DNA NOTE: One Y-DNA test result in FamilyTreeDNA Hordaland Group claims Haldor Johannesson Dale 1670-1744 Vaksdal HRD as ancestor.  IT is possible that this is the same as fathers line great-grandson to Rasmus Nilsson Tyssen.  H
2 CONC aplogroup: G-Z39541 estimated as formed 1450ybp, MRCA: 275ybp https://www.yfull.com/tree/G-Z39539/
2 CONT ** 2 other samples noted as in same haplogroup: 
2 CONT ** MDKA1: Jakob Vik before1640- Vikavågen HRD
2 CONT ** MDKA2: Mikkel Nilsson Vikebo (fca 1620 Meland, HRD) : https://www.geni.com/people/Mikkel-Vikeb%C3%B8/6000000012665174336
2 CONT *** Mulig bror til Rasmus Nilsson Tyssen???
