1 NOTE !SO: This information is from Hallvard Aanestad in letter dated Jan 24, 1987.
2 CONT      Hallvard has an electrical company in Varhaug,  AANESTAD ELEKTRO as.
2 CONT      His wife is Mary, born 1948.  1 daughter, Malfrid, born 1967 and 1 son,
2 CONT      Mads Ove, born 1966.
2 CONT                  Hallvard Aanestad
2 CONT                  Revhaugvn. 3
2 CONT                  4360 Varhaug
2 CONT                  Norway
2 CONT Further leads might come from Halvard.  Contact him again [x].
2 CONT HALVARD TARALDSON RISA is earliest name listed.  Wife not listed. Other
2 CONT children?
2 CONT From (A-020-Q) we get the birth date, also wife's name, and notation that they
2 CONT       had 7 children (no names listed other than Torstein).  Documentation not
2 CONT       given.
1 NOTE er nemnd  på Risa i Haa-Nærbø frå 1636 til 1665. Var laugrettesmann i 1640, skatta 1 ort i 1645. Fødd kring 1596. Første kona er ukjend, andre kona var Joren Helgesdatter. Han hadde to born i første gifte og 6 i andre. Det er skif
2 CONC te etter Halvard 18.12.1675.
