2 CONT '''Fogdenes og sorenskrivernes manntall 1664-1666 (not dated; Berg is listed at Langhus, and is claimed to be 70 years old at the time):'''
2 CONT RA, Fogdenes og sorenskrivernes manntall 1664-1666, nr. 11: Jæren og Dalane fogderi, 1664, s. 166-167. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/ft10041005310090
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record (24-08-1675; Berg had died, and the heirs are listed as the widow, Gjertrud Jakobsdatter, and their 3 children together: Jakob Bergsen, Randi d.y. Bergsdatter, and Guri d.y. Bergsdatter; as well as Berg's childre
2 CONC n from earlier marriage(s): Erik Bergsen Øystad; Kristen Bergsen; Peder Bergsen; Tollak d.e. Bergsen; Halgjerd Bergsdatter Dybing, who had died but was inherited by her children; Guri d.e. Bergsdatter Hetland, who had died but was
2 CONC  inherited by her children; Randi d.e. Bergsdatter; Tollak d.y Bergsen; and Ole Bergsen):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, SAST/A-100306/5/50BA/L0002: SKIFTEPROTOKOLL. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106650287
2 CONT ----
2 CONT '''Probate record (24-08-1675; Berg had died, and the heirs are listed as the widow, Gjertrud Jakobsdatter, and their 3 children together: Jakob Bergsen, Randi d.y. Bergsdatter, and Guri d.y. Bergsdatter; as well as the widow's st
2 CONC ep-children):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, SAST/A-100306/5, 1672-1693, s. 299. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20110328650439
2 CONT ----
2 CONT * [https://www.nb.no/items/7030d184bbc50ed3e1dac0748f60b679?page=376 "Hetland skipsreide i 450 år: Bind 1. Heskestad sokn gard, ætt og folk" (Langhus, 5. Berg Kristensson Langhus, pp. 367-368)]
2 CONT * [https://www.nb.no/items/7030d184bbc50ed3e1dac0748f60b679?page=241 "Hetland skipsreide i 450 år: Bind 1. Heskestad sokn gard, ætt og folk" (Grøssareid, 1. Kristen Tollaksson, p. 232)]
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Lars had at least 12 children (listed in his [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106650287 probate]):
2 CONT # Ole Bergsen, born about 1614.
2 CONT # Erik Bergsen, born about 1624.
2 CONT # Tollak d.e. Bergsen, born about 1626.
2 CONT # Kristen Bergsen, born about 1628.
2 CONT # Peder Bergsen, born about 1636.
2 CONT # Halgjerd Bergsdatter, probably born between about 1615 and 1635.
2 CONT # Guri d.e. Bergsdatter, probably born between about 1625 and 1645.
2 CONT # Tollak d.y. Bergsen, born about 1655, and can't have been born by the same mother as Ole Bergsen above.
2 CONT # Randi d.e. Bergsdatter, born about 1665. Was she the outcome of the case of sex outside of marriage for which he was convicted in 1664?
2 CONT # Jakob Bergsen. 
2 CONT # Randi d.y. Bergsdatter. 
2 CONT # Guri d.y. Bergsdatter. 
2 CONT The last 3 children were born between about 1675 and 1680 by his last wife, Gjertrud Jakobsdatter. The first 9 children were not the children of Gjertrud, and can't possibly have been born born by the same mother. At least one of 
2 CONC them (Randi d.e.) '''may''' have been born out of wedlock: The children must thus have been born by '''at least 3 (and possibly more) mothers'''. One of these may have been a daughter of Erik Tjørn. Yet, '''the identity of the mot
2 CONC her of each of the first 9 children is not known'''.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Some sources, including here at Geni, claim that Berg Kristensen Langhus (Grøsareid) had another son named Jakob Bergsen Nordland/Skruss-Eikeland. '''Is there any evidence that Jakob Bergsen Nordland/Skruss-Eikeland was a son of B
2 CONC erg Kristensen Langhus (Grøsareid)?'''  "Høyland: gards- og ættesoga" states that he was, both in the section on [https://www.nb.no/items/d63bfb43198e89d1eb04c0cdcae2d40d?page=306 Nordland] and [https://www.nb.no/items/d63bfb43198
2 CONC e89d1eb04c0cdcae2d40d?page=366 Skruss-Eikeland]. Yet, neither his [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20070619650673 engagement record dated 19-07-1716]; nor his [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20070619650683 marriage record dated 2
2 CONC 3-08-1716] makes any reference to his origin. Furthermore, [https://www.nb.no/items/d63bfb43198e89d1eb04c0cdcae2d40d?page=306 "Høyland: gards- og ættesoga"] states that he was born 1677 and died 1757. Yet, the Jakob Eikeland that 
2 CONC died in 1757, before his [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20070619660233 burial record dated 20-03-1757], is claimed to have been 68 years old at death, '''thus born about 1689, i.e. 14 years after the death of his supposed father
2 CONC , Berg Kristensen Langhus (Grøsareid)'''. Moreover, in three probates listing the children of Berg Kristensen Langhus (Grøsareid) there is only reference to one son named Jakob; namely: the probate after Berg Kristensen Langhus (G
2 CONC røsareid) [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106650287 dated 24-08-1675]; the probate after the only known child of his son Ole Bergsen Langhus, namely Anna Olsdatter Hetlandsgrunn, [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk200811067300
2 CONC 86 dated 25-06-1767]; and the probate after his son Erik Bergsen Langhus (Øystad-Øvre) [https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106650312 dated 22-03-1676]. In the second of these probates it becomes clear that the Jakob listed there
2 CONC  is Jakob Bergsen Langhus (Askje) (based on the names of his children listed there).
2 CONT ----
2 CONT http://poulkryger.dk/slaegt..html (Lagt til 27.07.2013)
2 CONT
2 CONT Han var gift flere ganger og barn utenfor ekteskap. Så sent som i 1664 måtte han sone for leigermål Det er derfor usikkert hvem som er mor til alle barna. Han må ha blitt gammel. Det er neppe slik at han gikk bort på 1660 tallet. 
2 CONC I gard og ætt for Høyland, under Nordland står det en Jakob født 1677. Det må da være en eyngre bror av den Jakob til Rennesøy (født 1667) Denne sønnen født 1677 finnes ikke unde rLanghus i Hetland skipreide bok 1 side 368. Men de
2 CONC t som står om telling 1701, virker interessant. En sammenheng finnes det mellom sønnen Jakob født 1677, men ikke helt hva.
