1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1653 var Jakob H. B. brukar etter kontribusjonsskatten til 2 laup. 1654 brukar til 3 laup 1 pd. 6 mk. 1656 var han nemnd lensmann. 1657 betalte han krøterskatt for 3 hestar, 12 kyr, 4 kviger, 12 geiter og 15 sauer.
2 CONC  Jakob var brukar og etter prestemanntalet 1664.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Google translate:
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1653, Jakob H. B. was a tenant according to the contribution tax for 2 laup. In 1654, tenant for 3 laup 1 pd. 6 mk. In 1656, he was named sheriff. In 1657, he paid herdsmen's tax for 3 horses, 12 cows, 4 heifers, 12 goats, and 
2 CONC 15 sheep. Jakob was a tenant according to the clergy census of 1664.
