2 CONT
2 CONT  Åsmund Johannesen STOKKA b: 1610 in Stokka, Vats, Rogaland, Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT  Siri Johannesdtr STOKKA b: ABT. 1611 in Stokka, Vats, Rogaland, Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT  Astrid Johannesdtr STOKKA b: 1611 in Stokka, Vats, Rogaland, Norway
2 CONT
