2 CONT Children:   
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Torgilsdatter Galtung-Torsnes b. in Torsnes.Jondal.Hordaland.Norway 
2 CONT
2 CONT Johannes Torgilsson Galtung-Fykse b. About 1560 in Fiksdal, Øystese, Hardanger, Hordaland, Norway. 
