1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sirdal gard og ættesoge bind 1 s.659
2 CONT
2 CONT Fyresdal is a municipality in Telemark county, Norway. It is part of the traditional region of Vest-Telemark. The administrative centre of the municipality is the village of Moland. The municipality of Moland was established on 1 
2 CONC January 1838 (see formannskapsdistrikt). In 1879, the name was changed to Fyresdal.
2 CONT
