2 CONT [https://www.nb.no/items/931a4ffb452f6a2306de08a17b4d6987?page=654 "Lunds historie" (p. 653)] states that Ådne Kjetilsen had an ''older brother'', Tosten Ribland, at Sokndal, who had a son named Hadle Tostensen. It also states tha
2 CONC t Ådne had a daughter married to Tosten Ribland. Elsewhere in [https://www.nb.no/items/931a4ffb452f6a2306de08a17b4d6987?page=661 "Lunds historie" (p. 660)] it is stated that Ådne Kjetilsen's ''daughter'' had a son named Hadle Tost
2 CONC ensen. [https://www.nb.no/items/77c60739b529aa5e7ddf70e0f4525809?page=302 "Sirdal bygdebok"] does not mention any brother named Tosten Kjetilsen. '''There is no evidence that Kjetil Halvardsen had a son named Tosten'''.
2 CONT ----
