1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "Mariet" is used as a short form of Margareta in Norrland, Sweden. Mariet Jönsdotter from Tuvan 2, was a sister of Erik Jönsson.
2 CONT
2 CONT Johan Bure's släktbok in autograph: "Härsse i Bure hans hustru het Hor [sic] Mariet af Tuwan. Erik Jonss. [sic] oförwägens syster" (English: "Härse at Bure. Hans Wife: Hot[?] Wife Mariet of Tuvan, Erik Jönsson's Sister of the inco
2 CONC mprehensible (oförwägens)." Johan Bure's family book in autograph, fol. 195r[p. 169] (quoted by Sikeborg). Note by Sikeborg: "The släktbok in autograph's abbreviation for the epithet "Hustru" or Wife ("Hu" or "Hw") has been misrea
2 CONC d as "Hor" (whore) in transcript X37.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Jönsdotter-328 (no sources)
2 CONT Urban Sikeborg, "Johan Bures släktbok" (USB) (2017), Person ID 2080.
2 CONT Ulf Lundström, "Skellefteå socken 1539-1650," p. 396, https://umu.diva-portal.org/smash/record.jsf?pid=diva2:729213&dswid=3108
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------------
2 CONT Margareta Jönsdotter var en syster till Erik Jönsson i Tuva nr 2.
2 CONT
2 CONT Källa: Bönder och gårdar i Ske-å socken (Ulf Lundström)
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Margeta Jönsdotter. Född i Tuvan, Skellefteå lfs.
