1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  "Farmer (Bonde) in Gammelbyn 8. Mentioned 1543-1555 in Gammelbyn, Burträsk, Skellefteå sn. (Skattelängder). Gammelbyn 8, "Svedjan" is stated to be separated from Gammelbyn 7, Västomsundet, Burträsk" (From Agneta O
2 CONC lofsson, cited in Geni). Grand Juror (Nämnd) 1535-1570 at Skattleängd, Gammelbyn (according to a note by Tommy Hernelind in familysearch profile L7JF-F7V).
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT Kråken 24 database, https://kråken.se/ person 525723 gives Mantel. (tax rolls) as birth source, b. ca. 1500.
