1 NOTE     * BIRTH: ABT 1510, Fosnes, NT
2 CONT     * DEATH: 1597, Trondheim 
1 NOTE SOURCE NOTES:
2 CONT http://www.ofstad.info/d0019/g0000022.html#I27852
