2 NOTE Jens Pedersen Schjelderup's seal used by his wife Susanna on parchment charter transferring property called Gassegrunn. They had owned the property since 1567, and she transferred it to Domincus Friis after Jens death. Parchment i
3 CONC s in University of Bergen archives, photo courtesy of them. Archive record notes it was unusual that a wife would retain possession of an important person's seal, as they are often abused and usually destroyed to avoid that.
1 NOTE Susanna fikk 10 barn, fire døtre og seks sønner.
