2 CONT
2 CONT Given Name: Mats 
2 CONT
2 CONT Surname: Samsonsson(?) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sex: M 
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 1440 
2 CONT
2 CONT Change Date: 11 Jan 2000
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Samson FILIPSSON b: 1421 in Losna 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Brynhild OLAVSDTR
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 1 Anna FARTEGNSDTR b: 1435 in Semling, Valdres
