1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Halvard (Halvor) Torgersen Ytre Eigeland ble født circa 1500 på Ytre Eikeland, Kvinesdal, Vest-Agder. Han var sønn av Torger Ytre Eigeland. Halvard (Halvor) Torgersen Ytre Eigeland ble gift med Hilleborg (Hendsesdt
2 CONC r.) Nei, hun var en Hujesdatter. Halvard (Halvor) døde på Austad.
2 CONT
2 CONT Halvard (Halvor) Torgersen Egeland married Hilleborg. He was born at Egeland ytre, Kvinesdal, Vest Agder, Norway. In 1553 he deeded his share of Ytre Egeland to his brother Vrål in exchange for land in the farms Lauen and Hundelan
2 CONC d in Hægbostad. He died at Lauen \ Hunddeland, Hægebostad, Vest Agder, Norway. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Barn:'''
2 CONT * Andres Halvorsen
2 CONT * Oluf (Ole) Halvorsen Austad+
2 CONT * Randi Halvorsdtr Øvre Kvås+
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Kilder: '''*Lyngdal. II.452.
2 CONT *Hetl.skp.II.562
2 CONT *Kvås 234
2 CONT *Kvinesdal 14
2 CONT *Austad II.180
2 CONT
2 CONT Ytre Egeland https://www.nb.no/items/24f5503536691172b319fa3642d808f3?page=17
2 CONT
2 CONT Kvås https://www.nb.no/items/6fc9c1daeebd2d4a67b5ccd097c3fa03?page=237
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth Location: Ytre Egeland, Kvinesdal, Vest-Agder
