1 NOTE {geni:about_me} There is no knowledge of who his father was, the Kvinesdal books only Calls him Torger (Torje), and mentions that nothing further is known about him. (He is only known through the patronym of his sons).
2 CONT
2 CONT Reference Book: Kvinesdal II.28, Kvinesdal I. 630, Feda 611. Kvinesdal I. 611 - Kvinesdal II.14 - Kvinesdal II. 28 - Feda 570.
2 CONT
2 CONT Torger (--?--) Egeland was born at Egeland ytre, Kvinesdal, Vest Agder, Norway. He was also known as Torje Egeland. He is mentioned Kvinesdal. II.14-15., Feda 570.
2 CONT
2 CONT Reference Book: Nes 2.I.274,403. - Reference Book: Hetl.skp.II.562 - Kvås 234  - Austad II.180 - Hetl.skp.II. 562.II.
2 CONT
2 CONT Alt. birthplaces: Kvaas and Ytre Egeland, Kvinesdal
