1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Tosten Tjodolfsen Ågedal married Åse Toresdtr Gare. He was born before 1485 at Ågedal ytre, Bjelland, Norway. He died at Gare østre, Spangereid, Vest Agder., Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT Åse Toresdtr Gare married Tosten Tjodolfsen Ågedal, son of Tjodolv Bjermodsen Ågedal and Torunn (--?--) Ågedal.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born before 1500 at Østre Gare, Spangereid, Vest Agder, Norway. She died at Østre Gare, Spangereid, Vest Agder, Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources: Kvinesdal Bygdebok site 381-384.
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------------- 
2 CONT
2 CONT Alternate birth dates: c. 1450, c. 1485
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT # 1430
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Kvinesdal bygdebok, p. 381-383 indicates Tosten was from Gare in Spangeeid, and was named in 1485.  Or he was from Aagedal in Bjelland. 
2 CONT https://www.nb.no/items/7cc9655e91149589c4ecf54b41c366b7?page=17
2 CONT
2 CONT Married to Aase Toresdatter of austre Gare, Spangereid.  (no other information about Aase in Kvinesdal bygdebok.)
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Nevnt i 1485
