2 CONC bars in a blue field.  On the helmet is a mirror with a silver handle and a gold border together with seven peacock plumes.  The mirror is a particularly Norwegian sign.     The family owned Toiten near Demmin in 1339, and later a
2 CONC lso had the properties in Krukow, Mussenthin and Padderow and lived there in 1626, but has since died out.
