1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Is there any ''evidence'' that Bjørn Gunbjørnsen Kvåvik had a daughter named Bergitte, and that this Bergitte was married to a Berge Torgersen Egeland (Årstad)?''' If anything, it could possibly have been that s
2 CONC he got married to Berge Torgersen Eikestein; but, is there any ''evidence'' for this? No such daughter is mentioned in  [https://www.nb.no/items/79bdb1afcaea6b10cb1cb7be8a00e72a?page=625 "Lyngdal II. Midtre del. Gard og Folk"].
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://www.nb.no/items/79bdb1afcaea6b10cb1cb7be8a00e72a?page=625 "Lyngdal II. Midtre del. Gard og Folk" (Kvåvik, Gårdnr. 170, Eiere og brukere av Kvåvig, Bjørn Gunbjørnsen Kvåvig, pp. 622-623)].
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://www.nb.no/items/876d3c181419a05b42a5169800396780?page=132 "Hetland skipsreide i 450 år: Bind 2. Helleland sokn: Gard, ætt og folk" (Eikestein, 1. Berg (dvs. Berge) på Eikestein, p. 123)]
