1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sigurd or Sjur is only known from the ''Smør-tavla'' from cirka 1547, made as a copy from the trial between Erik Ormson and Trond Benkestok. This table shows how Erik Ormsons wife and Trond Benkestok was related to
2 CONC  Jon Smør. Sjur is in the table as the husband of Inga Svalesdotter, and father of Ingrid and Christine Sjursdøtre. Beyond this information, it is not known who Sjur was.
2 CONT
2 CONT See ''Benkestok-seminaret'' page 22ff og ''Vår felles Slektshistorie'' chapter 4.
