1 NAME Finn Torgeirson //
2 GIVN Finn Torgeirson
2 SURN Aga
2 NICK Aske
2 NICK Torgersen
2 NICK Asche
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1360
2 PLAC Aga
2 ADDR
3 CITY Utne
