2 CONT
2 CONT Torberg married Gudrun Toresdtr Brandvik, daughter of Tore Trondesson and Unknown. (Gudrun Toresdtr Brandvik was born in 1370 in Brandvik, Huglo, Stord.)
2 CONT
2 CONT http://perso.wanadoo.fr/kelly.petit/330.htm
