1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.digitalniknihovna.cz/mzk/view/uuid:25024a40-7cec-11e3-b0d1-005056827e51?page=uuid:0b050650-8840-11e3-bbb0-5ef3fc9bb22f
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT The von dem Borne family is an old noble family originating from Pommern (north-east from Berlin). The family tree starts with '''Klaus von den Borne''', who died before 1484. Nowadays family members live in Germany and Holland. P
2 CONC art of the Dutch descendants carry the surname Kreutzwendedich von dem Borne. This site has been made to preserve and make available information about the family, especially the book about the family history, which was published b
2 CONC y Georg Schmidt in 1887
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.vondemborne.info/georg-schmidt-book/
