1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Svantepolk Knutsson's mother had been a Pomeranian lady whose first name and precise origin is not known to us, but who is indicated to have come from the ducal family of Pomerelia . 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hedvig? the wife of Knut Valdemarsson is considered to be a   r e l a t i v e  of the pomeranian dukes since they named a son with the unusual name Svantepolk. Her son Svantepolk was married before 1253. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Hedevig Svantepolksdatter von Pomorze Gdanskie''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Far	Swietopelk II Herzog von Pomorze Gdanskie,   f. 1190-1200, Poland ,   d. 10 jan. 1266, Poland
2 CONT * Mor	Euphrosyne,   f. eft. 1184,   d. 23 aug. 1235, Poland
2 CONT
