1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [http://www.geni.com/people/Erland-Thorfinsson-Jarl-of-Orkney-and-Caithness/6000000003646023907?through=6000000001052011900 ERLEND] Thorfinnsson (-in prison Trondheim [Nidaros] 1098, bur Trondheim).  
2 CONT
2 CONT m [http://www.geni.com/people/Thora-Sumarlidsdatter-Sida/6000000006589075249?through=6000000003646023907 THORA], 
2 CONT
2 CONT Erlend & his wife had four children:  [http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SCOTTISH%20NOBILITY.htm#_Toc268450047 (Cawley's Medlands)]
2 CONT
2 CONT a)         [http://www.geni.com/people/Erling-of-Orkneys/6000000003820968908 ERLING] (-[Ulster [May] 1103]).  
2 CONT
2 CONT b)         [http://www.geni.com/people/St-Magnus-Erlendsson/6000000008248157090 St MAGNUS] Erlendsson (-murdered Egilsay 16 Apr [1117], bur Christchurch at Birsay, transferred to Kirkwall Cathedral).  
2 CONT
2 CONT c)         [http://www.geni.com/people/Gunhild-Erlendottir/6000000001169154976 GUNHILD].  Orkneyinga Saga names “[http://www.geni.com/people/Gunhild-Erlendottir/6000000001169154976  Gunnhild] and [http://www.geni.com/people/Cecili
2 CONC a-Erlendsdatter/6000000008177258360 Cecilia]” as the two daughters of “Earl Erlend Thorfinnson” and his wife “Thora, the daughter of Sumarlidi Ospaksson”[913].  Orkneyinga Saga records that [http://www.geni.com/people/Magnus-III-O
2 CONC lavsson-%C2%ABBarefoot%C2%BB-Berrf%C3%B8tt/5381202464070053447 Magnus "Barelegs"] King of Norway “gave Earl Erlend´s daughter Gunnhild in marriage to [http://www.geni.com/people/Kol-Kali-Lalisson/6000000001169130795?through=600000
2 CONC 0001169154976  Kol], son of [http://www.geni.com/people/Kali-S%C3%A6bj%C3%B8rnson/6000000003820968938?through=6000000001169130795  Kali Sæbjarnarson], in compensation for the death of his father”, adding that her dowry was “some p
2 CONC roperty in Orkney including a farm at Paplay” and that the couple “settled down on his estate at Agder”[914].  
2 CONT
2 CONT m (Spring 1099) [http://www.geni.com/people/Kol-Kali-Lalisson/6000000001169130795?through=6000000001169154976  KOL] Kalisson, son of [http://www.geni.com/people/Kali-S%C3%A6bj%C3%B8rnson/6000000003820968938?through=600000000116913
2 CONC 0795  KALI] of Agdir in Norway & his wife ---.  Lenderman in Agder.  
2 CONT
