1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Margareta Petersdotter''' Näf (Lejon)
2 CONT
2 CONT Algot Brynjulfsen Gripshovid married Margrete Petersdtr, daughter of Lagmann Peter Nef Eskildsen.
