1 NOTE RESEARCH NOTES:
2 CONT King of Norway 1184-1202.  Reunified Norway 1184.  Ordained priest.
2 CONT His mother claimed he was son of Sigurd II.  Faeroes > Norway 1174 to claim
2 CONT throne.  Became king in Trondheim 1179. Excommunicated 1194 (for assertion
2 CONT of royal power to elect bishops).  Church waged war against him 1196-1202.
2 CONT nygols gives Astrid Roesd. as his mother, not wife -- all others agree she
2 CONT is wife.
