2 CONC datter/6000000008177258360 Cecilia]” as the two daughters of “Earl Erlend Thorfinnson” and his wife “Thora, the daughter of Sumarlidi Ospaksson”[913].  Orkneyinga Saga records that [http://www.geni.com/people/Magnus-III-Olavsson-%
2 CONC C2%ABBarefoot%C2%BB-Berrf%C3%B8tt/5381202464070053447 Magnus "Barelegs"] King of Norway “gave Earl Erlend´s daughter Gunnhild in marriage to [http://www.geni.com/people/Kol-Kali-Lalisson/6000000001169130795?through=600000000116915
2 CONC 4976  Kol], son of [http://www.geni.com/people/Kali-S%C3%A6bj%C3%B8rnson/6000000003820968938?through=6000000001169130795  Kali Sæbjarnarson], in compensation for the death of his father”, adding that her dowry was “some property i
2 CONC n Orkney including a farm at Paplay” and that the couple “settled down on his estate at Agder”[914].  
