2 CONC jw6pzp9tjiAhUEvZ4KHTzGAbAQ6AEwB3oECAoQAQ#v=onepage&q=Jon%20Hallkellson&f=false
2 CONT * The Heimskringla: Or, Chronicle of the Kings of Norway, Volume 3, By Snorri Sturluson, page 271 - https://books.google.com/books?id=9ZYBAAAAYAAJ&pg=PA271&lpg=PA271&dq=Gregorius+Jonsson+Huk&source=bl&ots=vpQ6KunUvD&sig=ACfU3U1XgY
2 CONC CR5sYcsWl0DUpATWvVCxGqjQ&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjJ-6Tq8NLpAhVRtZ4KHSYQAswQ6AEwEnoECAQQAQ#v=onepage&q=Gregorius%20Jonsson%20Huk&f=false
2 CONT * History of the Kings of Norway, by Snorri Sturluson - https://books.google.com/books?id=71U7xXIBbUgC&pg=PA840&lpg=PA840&dq=JON+Thorbergsson&source=bl&ots=FeGlC0Y7YY&sig=ACfU3U1QJjNU8Dnbsrnd8678lyuvDx0_YA&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjp
