2 CONC le", their father presumably being Baard although this is not stated in this passage[245].  King of the Birkebeiner.  '''He succeeded as King of Norway in 1204.'''  The Icelandic Annals record the death in 1204 of "rex Haquinus, S
2 CONC verreri filius" and the succession of "Ingo Bardi filius" aged 13 [although this age appears inconsistent with the chronology of the family][246].  '''Inge had one illegitimate child by GYRITH,''' daughter of ---:
