2 CONT Guttorm Asulfsson.
2 CONT His son: Baard GUTTORMSSON was born Abt 1150 in Of Rein, Rissa, Sor-Trondelag, Norway, and died 3 Apr 1194 in Florvag, Bergen, Hordaland, Norway. He was the son of 4. Guttorm ASULFSSON and 5. Sigrid THORKELSDATTER.
2 CONT
