1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Sigurd II Munn Haraldsson, King of Norway==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Kings Parents: King Harald 4 Gille (c. 1102 – 1136) and Tora boy Orm's daughter.
2 CONT * BORN 1133
2 CONT * DEAD June 10, 1155
2 CONT * PLACE OF DEATH Bergen, Begr. At Lille Kristkirke on Holmen
2 CONT * LIFETIME COMMENT (exact date of birth and place of birth are not known)
2 CONT
2 CONT * Brother of King Magnus 4 Sigurdsson 's blind (ca. 1115 – 1139); Brother of Brigida Haraldsdatter (mentioned 1130 – 1202); Half-brother of the Kings Inge 1 Haraldsson Krokrygg (1134/35 – 1161) and Øystein 2 Haraldsson (c. 1125 – 
2 CONC 1157); Cousin of Kristin Sigurdsdatter (c. 1125 – 1178); 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children==
