2 CONT Benedikt Folkesen was also known as Bengt Snivil. He married Ulvhild Bjørnsdtr Sweden, daughter of Bjørn Haraldsen Jernside and Katrin Ingesdtr Sweden. He was born at Sweden. He died at Sweden.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ulvhild Bjørnsdtr Sweden was also known as Ulvsdtr. She married Benedikt Folkesen, son of Jarl Folke Ingemunsen Digre and Ingerta Knutsdtr Sweden. She was born at Sweden. She died at Sweden.
