2 CONT
2 CONT Duncan, A.A.M., The Kingship of the Scots 842–1292: Succession and Independence. Edinburgh University Press, Edinburgh, 2002. ISBN 0-7486-1626-8
2 CONT
2 CONT Sturluson, Snorri, Heimskringla: History of the Kings of Norway, tr. Lee M. Hollander. Reprinted University of Texas Press, Austin, 1992. ISBN 0-292-73061-6
2 CONT
2 CONT Taylor, A.B., "Karl Hundason: King of Scots" in the Proceedings of the Society of Antiquaries of Scotland, LXXI (1937), pp. 334–340.
2 CONT
2 CONT Watt, D.E.R., "Bishops in the Isles before 1203" in The Innes Review, volume XLV, No. 2 (Autumn 1994). ISSN 0020-157X
2 CONT
