1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ingibiorg Finnsdottir (Standard Old Norse: Ingibjörg Finnsdóttir) was a daughter of Earl Finn Arnesson and Bergljot Halvdansdottir (Halfdansdottir), a niece of the Norwegian Kings Saint Olaf and Harald Hardraade. T
2 CONC he dates of Ingibiorg's life are not certainly known.
2 CONT
