1 NOTE Ingibjørg " Earlsdaughter " Finnsdatter of Halland
1 NOTE "ORKNEY"
1 NOTE Daughter or Widow of Thorfinn, Earl of Orkney. {Burke's Peerage} [GADD.GED]
1 NOTE Widow of the Earl of Orkney.
2 CONT Malcolm III Canmore (1058-93) came to the throne by disposing of his rivals and thereafter sought, in five unsuccessful raids, to extend his kingdom into northern England. Whereas his first wife, Ingibjorg, was the daughter of a N
2 CONC orse earl of Orkney, his second, Margaret, came from the Saxon royal house of England.
2 CONT Ingibjorg married Thorfinn the Black Sigurdsson, son of Sigurd "the Stout" Hlodvirsson and Daughter Of Scotland, before 1038. (Thorfinn the Black Sigurdsson was born in 1009 and died in 1064.)
1 NOTE SOURCE NOTES:
2 CONT http://www.geocities.com/marthajanehick/b67.htm#P6300
1 NOTE 1  NAME Inebiorg /Finnsdatter/ 1  DEAT 2  DATE ABT. 1066
1 NOTE
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.  Ingebjorg Finnsdotter (Finn's-Daughter) was the first wife of King Malcolm III (Canmore) of Scotland. Her first husband was Earl Thorfinn of Orkney, by whom she had two sons Paul and Erlend. Uponthe death of Thorfinn she marri
2 CONC ed Malcolm and had further children including the future King Duncan II of Scotland.
2 CONT
2 CONT References________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT      Orkneyinga Saga: The History of the Earls of Orkney Unknown GEDCOM info: MH:N99 Unknown GEDCOM info: 44EB16D4-2426-4264-A072-9945252C8903
1 NOTE REFN: P2084
2 CONT b. before 1028, d. before 1070, #104734
2 CONT Pedigree
2 CONT Last Edited=10 May 2003
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT      Ingibiorg 'Earl's Mother' Finnsdottir was born before 1028. She was the daughter of Finn Arnasson, Jarl of Halland and Bergljot.2 She married, firstly, Thorfinn Jamoforloney, Jarl of Orkney and Caithness, son of Sigurd II Dig
2 CONC ri, Jarl of Orkney and Caithness and Donalda of Alba, before 1038.2 She married, secondly, Malcolm III 'Caennmor', King of Scotland, son of Duncan I 'the Gracious', King of Scotland and Sybilla of Northumbria, between 1059 and 106
2 CONC 6.3 She died before 1070.2 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Ingibiorg 'Earl's Mother' Finnsdottir and Thorfinn Jamoforloney, Jarl of Orkney and Caithness
2 CONT Paul, Jarl of Orkney d. 1099
2 CONT Erlend, Jarl of Orkney d. 1099
