2 CONT * http://oursmallworld.org/1409%20Anders%20Bleikelia%20Forfedrebok.pdf
2 CONT * http://oursmallworld.org/1403%20Knut%20Odegarden%20Forfedre%2030%20g.pdf
2 CONT * https://genvagar.nu/show.asp?PersonId=617969
2 CONT
