2 CONC  Norway with his sons Ogmund, Fin and Thord, that Skopte died in Rome, and that his sons also died during the journey[48].  m GUDRUN, daughter of THORD Folason & his wife ---.  Snorre names "Gudrun, a daughter of Thord Folason" as
2 CONC  the wife of "Skopte Ogmundson"[49]. 
