2 CONT Vladimir II Monomakh, Prince of Novgorod and Kiev was the son of Vsevolod I, Grand Duke of Kiev and Irene (?). (2), (3) He married Gytha (?), daughter of Harold II Godwinson, King of England and Eadgyth Swanneshals (?). (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 19 May 1125.
2 CONT
2 CONT Vladimir II Monomakh, Prince of Novgorod and Kiev gained the title of Prince Vladimir of Kiev. He gained the title of Prince Vladimir of Novgorod. (1) He succeeded to the title of Grand Duke Vladmir II of Kiev in 1113. (2)
