1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [http://www.geni.com/people/Bj%C3%B8rn-P-Brox/285725352490006131 B.Brox]: Unknown mother(s) of the children, "friller".
2 CONT
2 CONT The mother of [http://www.geni.com/people/H%C3%A5kon-Magnusson-Toresfostre/353479885240011139 Håkon Toresfostre] by tradition unknown. Many have however defined his foster-sister [http://www.geni.com/people/Ragnhild-Steig/60000000
2 CONC 08177271154?through=353479885240011139 Ragnhild Toresdatter Steig] as his mother which is not unlikely since the tradition when taking a foster child it is very often a born out of wedlock grandchild. We keep her however unconnect
2 CONC ed since we don't have any sources on this.
2 CONT
2 CONT The mother of [http://www.geni.com/people/Sveinke-Steinarsson/6000000001169130560 Sveinke Steinarsson]'s [http://www.geni.com/people/Magnusdotter/6000000006961806584 wife] is only known as a "frilledatter" of king [http://www.geni
2 CONC .com/people/H%C3%A5kon-Magnusson-Toresfostre/353479885240011139 Håkon Magnusson Toresfostre].
2 CONT
2 CONT We have no sources telling that this is two different women or not, so we keep this profile just as a placeholder profile telling the story.
