2 CONT m as her second husband, RAGNHILD Haakonsdatter, widow of SKOPTI Skagasson, daughter of HAAKON Sigurdsson "the Mighty" Jarl, Regent of Norway & his wife Thora Skagadotter.  Snorre names Ragnhild as an illegitimate daughter of Haak
2 CONC on whom her father married to "Skopte Skagason, a brother of Thora" (the latter being Haakon's wife)[191].  Morkinskinna names “Ingibjorg, daughter of Hákon jarl” as mother of “one of King Magnus´s chieftains…Ormr”[192].  Snorre n
2 CONC ames Orm as the son of "Ragnhild, a daughter of Earl Hakon the Great"[193]. 
