2 CONT Some sources show Judith to be the daugther of Baldwin V.
2 CONT
2 CONT There has been a long debate over her paternity (i.e. which of hermother's two husbands was father - Richard III (d.1027) duke/count ofNormandy or Baldwin V (d.1065) count of Flanders). At one time it wasalso suggested that Judith
2 CONC  might be Baldwin's sister. ES II:79 goes forthe Richard III option.
