1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Bodil Håkonsdatter Princess of Denmark==
2 CONT
2 CONT Also Known As: "Bothild Haakon Daughter" 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Haakon Eirikson Ladejarl and Gunhild Burizleifmeita of Wenden 
2 CONT * BIRTHDATE: circa 1029 Birthplace: Vestfold Norway 
2 CONT * Death: Died in 1062 in Denmark 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Spouse==
2 CONT
2 CONT *Married:  '''Ulf Galliciensfahrer Ulfsson Earl of Denmark,''' 	Also known as "Ulf Galician traveler. Galicia-Traveler". King of. Denmark. from approx. From 1095 to 1103. Born approx. 1056. Married to Queen Bodil, daughter of Jarl
2 CONC  Thrugot Ulfsen. Killed both during the pilgrimage. Jarl Thrugot Ulfsen was the son of Ulf Galicienfahrer, Jarl of Denmark and Bodil Håkonsdatter. Bodil Håkonsdatter was the daughter of Jarl Håkon Eriksson, Norway and wife Gundhil
2 CONC d Burislawsdatter v. Wenden. Håkon Eriksson was the son of Jarl Håkonson and wife Gyda Svendsdatter of Denmark, who was the daughter of Svend Tveskæg. Gunhild Jurislawsdatter was the daughter of Prince Burislaw von Wenden and Thyr
2 CONC a Haraldsdatter, who was the daughter of Harald Blaatand. 
2 CONT * ULF Jarl in Denmark "Galicienfari", son of ? m BODIL Haakonsdotter, daughter of HAAKON Eriksson Jarl in Norway & his wife Gunhild of the Wends.  Her marriage and parentage is given in Knytlnga Saga[27].  Ulf & his wife had one c
2 CONC hild: 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children==
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Thrugot Ulfsen (Fagrskinna)''' THRUGOT Ulfsen "Fagrskinna".  Commander of household troops of Svend I Estridsen King of Denmark.  m THORGUNNA, daughter of VAGN Ågesen & his wife Ingeborg Thorkilsdatter.  Thrugot & his wife ha
2 CONC d three children: THORKIL Thrugotsen "SVEND Thorgunnasen, ASTRAD Thorgunasen and BODIL Thorgunnasdatter
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source''' Product MedLands, Denmark Nobility - http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/DANISH%20NOBILITY.htm#UlfGalicienfariMBodilHaakonsd
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Short History==
2 CONT
2 CONT Erik Ejegod, King of. Denmark. from approx. From 1095 to 1103. Born approx. 1056. Married to Queen Bodil, daughter of Jarl Thrugot Ulfsen. Killed both during the pilgrimage. Jarl Thrugot Ulfsen was the son of Ulf Galicienfahrer, J
2 CONC arl of Denmark and Bodil Håkonsdatter. Bodil Håkonsdatter was the daughter of Jarl Håkon Eriksson, Norway and wife Gundhild Burislawsdatter v. Wenden. Håkon Eriksson was the son of Jarl Håkonson and wife Gyda Svendsdatter of Denma
2 CONC rk, who was the daughter of Svend Tveskæg. 
2 CONT Gunhild Jurislawsdatter was the daughter of Prince Burislaw von Wenden and Thyra Haraldsdatter, who was the daughter of Harald Blaatand. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source''' http://www.toveogflemming.dk/tove/per05646.htm
