2 CONT     * Married: 808
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Died: 995, Finela's Castle, Fettercairn, Kincardine, Scotland 808
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Buried: Isle Of Iona, Scotland
2 CONT
2 CONT    Another name for Cináed was Kenneth II MAC ALPIN.
2 CONT
2 CONT    Ancestral File Number: 9G83-TS.
2 CONT
2 CONT    General Notes:
2 CONT
2 CONT     He succeeded his 3rd cousin, Cuilean, in 971. 12th King of Scots between 971 and 995.
2 CONT
2 CONT     He raided the North East as far as Stainmore, Teesdale in 971.
2 CONT
2 CONT     He was defeated by Uhtred, son of the elderly Earl of Bamburgh, after his attack on the North East after claiming the region as part of Scotland and taking advantage of the turmoil caused by the Viking attacks on England in 99
2 CONC 5. 5278 
2 CONT
2 CONT    Marriage Information:
2 CONT
2 CONT     Cináed married Unnamed Princess of Leinster 808. (Unnamed Princess of Leinster was born about 936 in Leinster, Ireland
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouses/Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Unnamed Princess of Leinster
2 CONT
