2 CONT [edit] External links
2 CONT
2 CONT     * CELT: Corpus of Electronic Texts at University College Cork The Corpus of Electronic Texts includes the Annals of Ulster, Tigernach and the Four Masters, the Chronicon Scotorum, as well as Genealogies, and various Saints' Li
2 CONC ves. Most are translated into English, or translations are in progress
2 CONT     * The Chronicle of the Kings of Alba
