2 CONC 0; vol. 5, p. 69, 208, 254; vol. 2, p. 17, 301. 3.Volver arriba ↑ Njáls saga: the Arna-Magnæan manuscript 468, 4.º (Reykjabók) (1962), (Copenhagen: Ejnar Munksgaard, c1962), FHL book 949.12 B4m v. 6., Chap. 96. 4.Volver arriba ↑ S
2 CONC taðarbræður og Skaraðssystur: niðjatal (1953), Óskar Einarsson, (Reykjavík, Iceland: Ísafoldarprentsmiðja H.F., 1953), FHL book 929.24912 J738e., pt. 3, br. 30. 5.Volver arriba ↑ Ættarskrá (1930), Bjarni Þorsteinsson, Guðný Bjarna
2 CONC dóttur, Þorstein Helgason, and Bjarni Þorsteinsson, (Reykjavík: Prentsmiðjan Acta H.F., 1930), FHL book 929.24912 T398t., p. 429. 6.Volver arriba ↑ Saga de Njal, cap. 96 7.Volver arriba ↑ Njáls saga: the Arna-Magnæan manuscript 46
2 CONC 8, 4.º (Reykjabók) (1962), (Copenhagen: Ejnar Munksgaard, c1962), FHL book 949.12 B4m v. 6., 906.228; p. 340. 8.Volver arriba ↑ Orkneyinga Saga, Anderson, Joseph, (Edinburgh: Edmonston and Douglas, 1873), FHL microfilm 253063., xx
2 CONC ix p. 47. 9.Volver arriba ↑ Saga de Njal, cap. 100 10.Volver arriba ↑ Gwyn Jones, A History of the Vikings, Oxford University Press, 1973, p. 285-6. 11.Volver arriba ↑ Saga de Njál, cap. 156 12.Volver arriba ↑ Steingrimur Jonsson,
