2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes of Aquitaine was a daughter of Duke William IX of Aquitaine.
2 CONT
2 CONT She first married Aimery V of Thouars. In her second marriage, she bore Petronila of Aragon, the daughter and heiress of Ramiro II of Aragon.
