2 CONT
2 CONT      Béla II Arpád, King of Hungary was born circa 1109. (1) He was the son of Almus Arpád, Duke of Croatia and Predslava of Kiev. (1) He married Helen of Serbia in 1129. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died in 1141. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT      Béla II Arpád, King of Hungary succeeded to the title of King Béla II of Hungary in 1131. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Béla II Arpád, King of Hungary and Helen of Serbia
