1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''GÉZA II King of Hungary ([1130]-3 or 31 May 1162, bur Székesfehérvár)'''
2 CONT s/o of BÉLA II "the Blind" King of Hungary & Jelena of Serbia
2 CONT x (1146) IEVFROSINA Mstislavna of Kiev ([1130]-1186 or <), d/o MSTISLAV II Vladimirovich "the Great" Grand Prince of Kiev & [Liubava] Dmitrievna 
2 CONT *ELISABETH ([1144/45]-12 Jan >1189) x  (>1157) FRIEDRICH of Bohemia
2 CONT * ISTVÁN III King of Hungary (1147-murdered Gran 4 Mar 1172, bur Esztergom) x (1168)  AGNES of Austria
2 CONT *BÉLA III King of Hungary (1149-23 Apr 1196, bur Székesfehérvár, transferred to Coronation Church Budapest) 
2 CONT * ÁRPÁD
2 CONT * GÉZA (-< 1209)
2 CONT *ODOLA x ([1164]) SVATOPLUK of Bohemia
2 CONT *ILONA ([1158]-25 May 1199)  x (12 May 1172) LEOPOLD of Austria
