2 CONT
2 CONT Duke Géza (c. 1150 – before 1210)
2 CONT
2 CONT Odola (? – ?), wife of Duke Sviatopluk of Bohemia
2 CONT
2 CONT Helena (c. 1158 – 25 May 1199), wife of Duke Leopold V of Austria
