1 NOTE Geza III, son of King Bela II, succeeded his father as King of Hungary as King Geza II in 1141, he ruled until 1161, and was succeeded by his son, Stephen III.
1 NOTE 429873850. Kong Geisa II BELASON av Ungarn(15340) was born in 1130.(15341) He was a Konge in 1141 in Ungarn.(15342) He died on 31 May 1162.(15343) Han seiret i kamp mot russere og gekere. I hans regjeringstid innvandet tallrike Sa
2 CONC chsere til Ungarn. Han lot dem 1143 bosette set i grevskapet Scepuze (Szepes, Zeps) og flere områder i Transylvania, hvor deres etterkommere lever ennu i dag. He was married to Euphrosina MTITSLAVSDTR av Kiev in 1146
