2 CONT ****** F4. Helene Komnenodukaina, heiress of Lamia and Larissa; 1m: Guillaume de la Roche-sur-Yon, Duke of Athens (+1287); 2m: 1291 Hugues de Brienne, Cte di Lecce
2 CONT ****** F5. a daughter; m.Andronikos Tarchaneiotes (+1283)
2 CONT ****** F6. [parentage not certain] Jelena, +1298/9; m.ca 1276 (repudiated 1283) Stephen Uros, King of Serbia (+1321)
