1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ''from '''https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/SWEDEN.htm#RagnvaldUlfsson '''  on June 25th 2026
2 CONT
2 CONT '''ULF''' ---.  Snorre records Ulf as the brother of Sigrid "Storråda/the Haughty"[96].  
2 CONT '''m''' ---.  The name of Ulf's wife is not known.  
2 CONT Ulf & his wife had one child: 
2 CONT
2 CONT a)         '''RAGNVALD Ulfsson''' .  
2 CONT Snorre names "Earl Ragnvald, Ulf's son" when recording his [first] marriage[97].  
2 CONT '''Jarl in Västergötland.'''  Snorre records that Ragnvald accompanied Ingegerd to Russia and was installed as Earl of Ladoga[98].  
2 CONT '''m firstly INGEBORG''' Trygvesdatter, daughter of TRYGVE Olavsson of Norway & his wife Åstrid Eiriksdatter.  Snorre records the marriage of "Ingebjorg, Trygve's daughter, King Olaf's sister" and "Earl Ragnvald, Ulf's son"[99].  
2 CONT '''m secondly''' [as her first husband,] '''ASTRID''' Njalsdotter, daughter of NJAL --- & his wife ---.  
2 CONT The primary source which confirms her parentage and two marriages has not yet been identified.  [She married secondly as his second wife, Emund Slemme "den Gamle/the Old" King of Sweden.  Her supposed second marriage to Ragnvald m
2 CONC ay be nothing more than a guess based on Adam of Bremen recording that "nepos eius [=rex Sueonum Emund] Stinkel" succeeded on the death of Emund[100].]  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Jarl Ragnvald & his first wife had two children:''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT i)          '''ULF''' .  Snorre names "Earl Ulf and Earl Eilif" as the sons of Ragnvald & his wife[101]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ii)         '''EILIF''' .  Snorre names "Earl Ulf and Earl Eilif" as the sons of Ragnvald & his wife[102]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Jarl Ragnvald & his second wife had one child:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT iii)        '''STENKIL Ragnvaldson''' (-1066).  The primary source which confirms his parentage has not yet been identified.  He succeeded [his stepfather] in 1060 as STENKIL King of Sweden. 
