1 NOTE years, William presided over a gradual
1 NOTE confiscation of lands, which the Norman Barons received. As a result
1 NOTE redistribution of land in England. Saxon rebellions led to the
1 NOTE blessing. He gained victory at the Battle of Hastings and was
