1 NOTE Fue hija de la Reina Matilde de Inglaterra y viuda de Ricardo III, Duque de Normandía.
1 NOTE Marriage was a contract, not an actual marriage
1 NOTE _P_CCINFO 2-2438
1 NOTE épouse Richard III duc de Normandie (elle se remarie avec Baudouin V comte de Flandre).
1 NOTE She married first 1027 Richard III Duke of Normandy (997 † 1027). They had two children: Alice of Normandy and Agnes d'Evreux. As a widow, she remarried in 1028 in Paris to Baldwin V of Flanders (1012 † 1067). Their children were:
2 CONT
2 CONT Baldwin VI of Flanders, (1030 † 1070) 
2 CONT Matilda of Flanders (1032 † 1083). In 1053 she married William Duke of Normandy, the future king of England 
2 CONT Robert I of Flanders, (1033-1093) 
2 CONT Henry of Flanders (c. 1035)
2 CONT
2 CONT As the wife of Baldwin V, she was Countess of Flanders from 1036 to 1067
