1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Evidence needed to support as daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Marchese-di-di-Susa-DIY/6000000219443258821?through=6000000006906578140 or of https://www.geni.com/people/Konrad-II-of-Carinthia/600000003597085
