1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''VLADIMIR Sviatoslavich ([960]-Berestov 15 Jul 1015) I "Velikiy/the Great" Grand Prince of Kiev.'''
2 CONT s/o SVIATOSLAV I Grand Prince of Kiev & his mistress Malusha [Malfred] .
