0 @N6000000002322323277@ NOTE It's not clear if he was, or was not, the son of Boleslaw II, but, for this
1 CONT family tree, we'll assume, until proven otherwise, that he was the son, or at
1 CONT least one of the sons of Boleslaw II. It was mentioned that when Boleslaw II
1 CONT was exiled from Poland in 1079 that he "took his son with him". Was this the
1 CONT son he took with him?? Did he return to claim th throne of Poland?? Nothing
1 CONT else has been discovered about Wladislaw I Herman except that he had a son,
1 CONT Boleslaw III who succeeded him upon his death in 1102 as Prince of Poland.
