1 CONC ut after Vladimir was sent by his father torule Chernigov and Oleg made peace with the Polovtsi to retake thatcity from him, they parted company. Since that time, Vladimir and Olegwere bitter enemies who would often engage in inte
1 CONC rnecine wars. Theenmity continued among their children and more distant posterity.
