1 CONT Adelaide de France was the daughter of (?) Robert II [King of France] and Constance of Provence. She married Richard III Duke of Normandy in 1027.1 She married (?) Baldwin V, deLille Count of Flander circa 1028.2,3,4 Adelaide died
1 CONC  between 8 January 1079 and 1080 at Messines
